      "depth": 0,
      "kind": "section",
      "number": "3",
      "title": "General Requirements",
      "body": "Textiles and Leather must:\n\n● be based on historical sources,\n\n● not be of a clearly modern color (I.E neon or fluorescent),\n\n● be maintained in a good shape prior to any Buhurt International Event,\n● not be decorated with modern images, offensive logos, etc.",
