    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "4.2",
      "title": "Specific Requirements",
      "body": "Any material listed in 4.1 is Approved.\nAny material based on historical sources thus not listed in 4.1 is Approved.\nIt is Approved to use a modern material under the following conditions:\n\n● the modern material replicates the aesthetic of an approved material listed in 4.1,\n● the modern material is strong enough to endure full contact fights and to not be damaged too easily.\nWe recommend asking for approval of the Authenticity Committee regarding modern materials before placing an order for an item made of such material.\n\nAny clearly modern cloth element, such as underpants, sport legging, knee pad etc., must not be visible from any position.",
