    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "5.2",
      "title": "Specific Requirements",
      "body": "Any natural leather is Approved.\nIt is Approved to use a modern material under the following conditions:\n\n● the modern material replicates the aesthetic of an approved material listed in 4.1,\n● the modern material is strong enough to endure full contact fights and to not be damaged too easily.\nWe recommend asking for approval of the Authenticity Committee regarding modern materials before placing an order for an item made of such material.\n\nSpecific Requirements for boots and shoes Boots and shoes must:\n\n● be based on historical sources,\n● be fastened by leather laces, fabric laces or any historically plausible mechanism,\n● have a flat sole made of leather, or modern material.\n\nModern rubber soles must be flat or with very low texture.\nIt is Denied to use rubber sole to mimic hiking boots sole Modern soles must be black or brown, with no modern flashing color.",
