      "body": "Below, we will keep track of all the changes made over the lifetime of this document. This way, all our members can see how the documents are changing over time.\n\nJanuary - 2026 (V. 26.1) Formatting redone for consistency and readability. Except points listed below, no content changes.\n\nAdd: “1. Implementation” (and subsequent modification of all Title numbers in the document) Clarification:\n\n- Split of “1. Definition and general requirements” in “2. Definition and description” and “3. General Requirements”. This split doesn’t have an impact on the content of the rules.\n\n- In “2.2. Textiles and leather” : “All skin of a competitor must be covered.“\n\nMarch-2025 (V2025.03)\n- Add: 3.2: Boots and shoes must have a flat sole made of leather, or modern material\n- Add: 3.3: examples of Denied and Approved shoe soles\n\nDecember-2024: -Add Document has been created",
